{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Salvador","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8pLnnRB2qG1vZHXpjm2gVFNyUX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iREgT7QU8Dfrjh0nzZpN8IspMTQ.jpg","description":"During a violent confrontation arranged between radical fans of two football clubs, Salvador Aguirre, an ambulance driver, rescues his injured daughter Milena, a member of the ultra group, which defends racist, violent and homophobic values, totally opposed to those he instilled in her.\n\nRated TV-MA · Ended · First aired 6 Feb 2026 · Spain · Language: Spanish\nStudio: Alea Media · Network: Netflix\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: Spanish","releaseInfo":"2026","genres":["Drama","Mystery","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.1","title":"Night of Sirens","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"On a tense night in Madrid, as Spanish and French hooligans face off, an ambulance driver reels from seeing his daughter among the violent crowd.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xvOUJJex7ZchqIVSJtN0jCNQBTy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.2","title":"Conflicting Feelings","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"At the funeral, a bereft Salvador is caught off guard, drawing unwanted attention. As the police investigation stalls, he looks for answers elsewhere.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yLRcAEbDFta4uxeSgsRWw26UQff.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.3","title":"\"Quid Pro Quo\"","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Salvador's perspective starts to shift and Julia edges closer to Nacho, the White Souls need someone to take the fall for the Molotov cocktail.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/96FNCgekshW8C23dfDwJDydf9I6.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.4","title":"Minute of Silence","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A heated incident on the job pulls Salvador and Marjane apart. The White Souls pay homage to Milena as they prepare to wreak havoc in Marseille.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pzlVccTeAX9C5UgHhDvN2MxtyWA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.5","title":"Siren Songs","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"When footage from the airport makes headlines, Salvador hits another low point. Disgusted by a new narrative being peddled, Martín doesn't hold back.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Ad3BPy3zSI3mVwvo3OwM4gtkEls.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.6","title":"The Dinner","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hoping to move on, Salvador lays Milena to rest. But as violent footage of her murder goes viral, he attends an explosive dinner in the lion's den.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gGaPTq458U7vN1XB7M8SuzC8yW3.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI2L1NhbHZhZG9yJTIwJTI4MjAyNiUyOS8.1.7","title":"\"Incel\"","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2026-02-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Milena's killer becomes known to a select few, Martín, Carla and Julia face uncomfortable truths while others race to control the story.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7JFJ1CwhEitxechszBwsmN6P6mi.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20